      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a political thriller novel. i need help with a character named Elias. hes this high-level, super intense technocrat who thinks the only way to prevent societal collapse is through a centralized, AI-driven government that manages all resource allocation and makes policy decisions based on pure data, bypassing human politics entirely. can u write a monologue for him where he's explaining to a skeptic why this is the only logical way to save the country?",
